I've got a patch that makes {get,set,swap}context() system calls,
removing them from libc.  I've built and tested an i386 kernel,
but can only build an alpha kernel (a buildworld is in progress
now).

Can someone test an alpha kernel with this patch?

For sparc, ia64, and powerpc, I just returned ENOSYS for now.
It shouldn't break any builds and can be implemented later.

Thanks,

