Sounds like a problem I was having with my Miata when the new XFree86 came
out. All I did to get things to work was to move the Matrox from the 64-bit
slot to one of the 32 bit PCI slots.

Of course, I am assuming that you have your Matrox plugged into one of the
64 bit slots. :)

HTH,

AJ

