Bear in mind that a PCI IDE board will not be usable as a boot device.

Since you apparently do not live near a PC store and returns are not
an option, Do some web/news searches for things that work and things
that don't work at all on alpha.  The SRM sometimes maps the memory or
io space so high that poorly designed boards can't cope with it.

FWIW, I have a Promise ATA/33 board that works just fine in a Miata.

